Subject: [PATCH] Report cumulative temporal sample progress to output drivers

Locked-Patch: patches/0085-temporal-output-sample-count.patch
Locked-Patch-SHA256: 23fa2425fc582df90c6c80cb8f15db0dfcf62a16e3c6e69436cb5dc80c96b92b
Contract: Report cumulative sample progress across temporal denoising updates while using the current buffer accumulation count for pixel normalization.
Related-Fixture: tests/houdini_dlss_worker_smoke.py

Rebased-From: 30ae38908d4a29e9e3d34c2dbac6f874667527b8
Previous-Patch: patches/0085-temporal-output-sample-count.patch
Previous-Patch-SHA256: 23fa2425fc582df90c6c80cb8f15db0dfcf62a16e3c6e69436cb5dc80c96b92b
Rationale: The local output-driver sample accessor reports generation progress to Houdini. Temporal denoising resets the current pixel accumulation while the generation continues rendering.
Contract: Report cumulative sample progress across temporal denoising updates while using the current buffer accumulation count for pixel normalization.
Tests: tests/houdini_dlss_worker_smoke.py, scripts/verify-upstream-patches.py

diff --git a/src/integrator/path_trace.cpp b/src/integrator/path_trace.cpp
index 9de94fe879ec3a8defc48a11eb0d41ec3e3434f5..5b569064f9ecbe81c80af26dc35d2a630e22917e 100644
--- a/src/integrator/path_trace.cpp
+++ b/src/integrator/path_trace.cpp
@@ -1215,6 +1215,14 @@ int PathTrace::get_num_render_tile_samples() const
   return render_scheduler_.get_num_rendered_samples();
 }
 
+int PathTrace::get_total_render_tile_samples() const
+{
+  if (full_frame_state_.render_buffers) {
+    return full_frame_state_.render_buffers->params.samples;
+  }
+  return render_scheduler_.get_total_rendered_samples();
+}
+
 bool PathTrace::get_render_tile_pixels(const PassAccessor &pass_accessor,
                                        const PassAccessor::Destination &destination)
 {
